# headwear/helm/greathelm_plume: the great helm's plume (P2c ladder slice, LADDER-HEAD; T5-T6, the `plumes` flag): a
# spray of feathers in the plume slot from a small holder at the crown's off side, sweeping back (behind the head facing R
# and L, where the brush hides it: those views are empty). Light from the top-left (a lit cap, the shadowed lower back). Rises to F-37 at most. Channel `crest` as the crest:
# rest; up (the bob lag); breeze (the stir: the top leans a pixel out). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role helm form3
role helm band3
layer headwear
anchor head
keys crest
z 1
tags overlay
legend Q plume 0
legend R plume 1
legend S plume 2
legend T plume 3
legend U plume 4

# (FORGE-HELM i2 plume_yield.py) the forge crest replaces the plume at T1-T4: empty views (begin)
view D key breeze when forge-homespun,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view D key rest when forge-homespun,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view D key up when forge-homespun,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view L key breeze when forge-homespun,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view L key rest when forge-homespun,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view L key up when forge-homespun,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view R key breeze when forge-homespun,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view R key rest when forge-homespun,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view R key up when forge-homespun,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view U key breeze when forge-homespun,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view U key rest when forge-homespun,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view U key up when forge-homespun,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view D key breeze when forge-tanner,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view D key rest when forge-tanner,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view D key up when forge-tanner,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view L key breeze when forge-tanner,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view L key rest when forge-tanner,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view L key up when forge-tanner,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view R key breeze when forge-tanner,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view R key rest when forge-tanner,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view R key up when forge-tanner,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view U key breeze when forge-tanner,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view U key rest when forge-tanner,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

view U key up when forge-tanner,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.





























































































































































